1)  Never attach your data.  I cannot emphasize this enough.

2)  There is a problem with your CSV file.  You have a character in a cell
that R cannot recognize, likely because that character is not ASCII text. I
would clean your CSV file and try again.  If you are using a non-English
version of Excel to create the file, that could be the problem (because the
alphabet could be non-ASCII).

Yours,
Olivia

